# arch-timeshift-vm (Ansible local executor) - narrow passwordless elevation.
#
# The playbook escalates through Ansible become, which shells out as /bin/sh,
# so per-binary Cmnd entries cannot match at the sudo layer. The safe surface
# is therefore the wrapper itself: it validates every invocation (safety
# gates, config, locks) before delegating to the playbook.
#
# Users in the wheel group may run the tool without a password prompt, while
# every other sudo use keeps requiring authentication. Do NOT relax this to
# NOPASSWD: ALL.
%wheel ALL = NOPASSWD: /usr/local/bin/arch-timeshift-vm